        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 ’Niu Guangc Poubauhmei taanv taanhmei adih gay,",
            "’Niu #^5 phungc guangmei bumaengc hei kunghmei e;",
            "Reynungc #^5 saa guangmei latchap khou nai e:",
            "“Bumaengh khuammei ’takmei e.”",
            "",
            "“Bumaengh khuammei ’takmei e”",
            "Tingpuk paengc thangc kai khou 5#^",
            "Kaniw khang ch’rynmei swan hymdaih pyrun nai;",
            "“Bumaengh khuammei ’takmei e.”",
            "",
            "2 Kaikhunh panty khou gaymei khei padikna,",
            "Tingmik machang Jisu khei luic hay hayna,",
            "Zianmei nunc ta kauh chaeng ’niu zaylou nuh e;",
            "Bumaengh khuammei ’takmei e.”",
            "",
            "3 ’Paeng-’zaan thangc huayneyna chamv dinc tat pwkhou,",
            "Chaeng ’maanmei ta kabamv ’thuic khou phu tat ni;",
            "Lauziu Gaenghmeipu lev ’niu neihlaa ’chamc ni:",
            "“Bumaengh khuammei ’takmei e.”",
            "",
            "4 Gaychamv thw duipaengc dic gay khou nrou o,",
            "Zianpui lat 5#^ saana, zianpui taanv taancna,",
            "Guloumeipu khou paapcmei ta zay guang kho;",
            "“Bumaengh khuammei ’takmei e.”"
          ]
        }
      },
